{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id328728212"}, "name":{"label":"QueenMackkenzie"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-28T22:01:58-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.26.1"}, "id":{"label":"14118206756"}, "title":{"label":"3 months of couple joy"}, "content":{"label":"I love the questions and quizzes available on this app, it helps me and my partner keep our communication strong with the distance. I love the ability to see my partner’s status updates and messages on my lock screen. I love being able to mark memories and special days. My suggestions to make this app even better would be constant location tracking not just when the app is opened, my partner and i both have our locations set to always but they only open when the app is open. As an iPhone user I wish I could have the widget to just see my partners status without the distance on my home screen. An awesome addition would but like a collaborative relationship/couples calendar.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1624758651&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
