{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id1465721848"}, "name":{"label":"andA_frintal_panda"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-08-18T18:19:12-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.21.0"}, "id":{"label":"13033434133"}, "title":{"label":"Rip off"}, "content":{"label":"Don’t get me wrong, this app is packed with a ton of amazing features. However, the egotistical, self-absorbed, ignorant d-bag of a developer who can’t get his own girlfriend decided that this app is worth $60. I say “this app” because legit everything on this app is behind a paywall. Save yourself the time and disappointment and just use the app to inspire your own way to connect with your partner. That is what I’m doing, I am ripping off the questions, the format, and the widget to make my own inexpensive way to keep my relationship fresh. If any of the developers are reading this, please note, you are scum.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1624758651&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
